      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-26T14:50:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've never found Miss Information particularly tough, just… Boring. (The Dreamer, on the other hand, seems like a 4 to me.)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I find that she really takes a lot of the heroics out of the game.&nbsp; Whether you play/draw cards or not, you're typically just waiting for her to stop wrecking your stuff with Clues and Diversions until she finally flips.&nbsp; From there it's just surviving her hitting you 1-2 times on her turn and each hero when they deal damage to her on their respective turns.&nbsp; Yikes.</p>",
