      "created_at": "2013-08-26T15:21:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I like the Mechanics of Miss Information.</p><p>Basically the heroes are waiting for her to screw up, the more investigative (deck manipulation) you have the faster you can find her.</p><p>After that she's nasty, but she knows them so she whould be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She also seems much easier with 3 heroes than 4, at least in the games I've played with her.</p>",
