      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I like the Mechanics of Miss Information.</p><p>Basically the heroes are waiting for her to screw up, the more investigative (deck manipulation) you have the faster you can find her.</p><p>After that she&#39;s nasty, but she knows them so she whould be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>She also seems much easier with 3 heroes than 4, at least in the games I&#39;ve played with her.</p>",
