      "created_at": "2013-08-26T20:12:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree that while she's kind of tough, she's mostly just not that interesting to fight, since what she mostly does is take away your ability to do fun stuff on your turn.&nbsp; We've played her a couple of times, but she's definitely not one we pull out for a rip-roarin' good time on game night.</p>",
