      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-26T22:34:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kismet is an interesting one, I've played her several times, and it's either a weak fight where the heroes are signing autographs and posing for pictures while saving hte day, or it's a murderous rampage by this goddess of carnage. &nbsp;She is tough with three, with four there is a rare total crushing defeat mixed in with a lot of easy wins.</p>",
