      "created_at": "2013-08-27T01:59:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you can get your ongoing destruction out early, then you can control her without too much trouble, but if she's allowed to build up her jinxes and gets lady luck out, that can be one nasty fight.</p>",
