    {
      "id": 71326,
      "name": "PePe QuiCoSE",
      "username": "PePe_QuiCoSE",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/ecae2f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-27T13:46:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a funny game with Kismet where her jinxes did nothing. Don't recall the cards but basically it stuck on the same hero the ones that made him deal 1 damage to himself and reduce damage dealt by that hero. And I like the flow Kismet has with 3 Heroes, you steal her Talisman and then pound on her. She gets her Talisman back about 1 or 2 turns before she is done, but when she does she deals a lot of damage if you haven't been destroying jinxes. Also Lady Luck preventing her destruction is fun, good times to have her Talisman in hand for that! From the solo-villains pack (Rat, Spite, IL) she has been the most fun.</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
